            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Step, "Tap **Transport**, then **Road**, and drag a street in from the edge of the map. A road reaching the edge is how people and goods get in and out: when it asks, choose **Link it**. On an island, drag a street across it instead: people come by boat, and a wharf later takes the goods out. On an island, drag a street across it instead: people come by boat, and a wharf later takes the goods out.", "Click **Transport**, then **Road**, and drag a street in from the edge of the map. A road reaching the edge is how people and goods get in and out: when it asks, choose **Link it**. On an island, drag a street across it instead: people come by boat, and a wharf later takes the goods out. On an island, drag a street across it instead: people come by boat, and a wharf later takes the goods out."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Step, "Tap **Zones**, pick **Residential** and drag a block along the street. Lots grow up to three tiles from a road.", "Click **Zones**, pick **Residential** and drag a block along the street. Lots grow up to three tiles from a road."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Step, "Zone some **Commercial** and **Industrial** too. Homes need jobs, and shops need people."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Step, "Press play."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Para, "Cottages, stores and workshops go up over the next few weeks. None of them need power or water yet."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Heading, "What the town asks for"),
