            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Para, "The line under the strip says what's holding the town back, worst first: no road to a block, no power, no mains water, or too little money. Tap it to go to the place.", "The line under the strip says what's holding the town back, worst first: no road to a block, no power, no mains water, or too little money. Click it to go to the place."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Para, "Houses want power before long and larger houses want mains water. Under **Utilities**, a **Coal power station** and a line of **Power line** to the zones bring power, and a **Pumping station** beside water with mains along the streets brings water. Drawing a road with **With pipes under it** on lays the mains as you go."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Heading, "Money"),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Para, "Each month the town collects taxes and pays upkeep on everything you've built. Tap the money in the strip for the budget. Taxes start at 7%. Raising them brings in more but slows growth, and lowering them does the reverse.", "Each month the town collects taxes and pays upkeep on everything you've built. Click the money in the strip for the budget. Taxes start at 7%. Raising them brings in more but slows growth, and lowering them does the reverse."),
            ManualBlock(ManualKind.Heading, "Time and speed"),
